  # ━━ GROUP B: Boundary Conditions ━━

  # Why: Just-inside boundary — manifest metadata at exactly 64KB should
  # be accepted per AgentManifest validation
  @boundary
  Scenario: Manifest with metadata at the 64KB limit is accepted
    Given the Architect Agent is configured with metadata of exactly 64KB
    When the agent starts in serve mode
    Then the manifest should be published successfully

  # Why: Just-outside boundary — manifest metadata over 64KB must be
