  @boundary
  Scenario: Agent accepts a command when one slot remains
    Given the Architect Agent is processing 1 task
    And max_concurrent is 2
    When a CommandPayload arrives with command "feasibility"
    Then the command should be accepted and processed

  # Why: Just-outside max_concurrent — agent at capacity must reject
