  @boundary @negative
  Scenario: Agent rejects a command when at maximum concurrency
    Given the Architect Agent is processing 2 tasks
    And max_concurrent is 2
    When a CommandPayload arrives with command "feasibility"
    Then the command should be rejected with a capacity error
    And the ResultPayload should indicate failure

  # Why: Heartbeat timeout boundary — at exactly the timeout threshold
