  @edge-case
  Scenario: Agent re-registration updates the existing manifest
    Given the Architect Agent was previously registered with version "0.1.0"
    When the agent starts again with version "0.2.0"
    Then the manifest in the registry should be updated to version "0.2.0"
    And only one entry for "architect-agent" should exist

  # Why: NATS reconnection after transient network failure — heartbeat
