  # [ASSUMPTION: confidence=medium] Agent re-publishes manifest and resumes heartbeat on reconnection
  @edge-case
  Scenario: Agent resumes operation after NATS reconnection
    Given the Architect Agent is registered with the fleet
    When the NATS connection is temporarily lost
    And the connection is re-established
    Then the agent should re-publish its manifest
    And heartbeat publishing should resume
    And the agent should resume accepting commands

  # Why: Long-running tasks (greenfield, explore) must not block the
