  @edge-case
  Scenario: Heartbeat continues during a long-running task
    Given the Architect Agent is processing a greenfield session
    And the session takes longer than the heartbeat interval
    When the heartbeat interval elapses
    Then a heartbeat should be published with status "busy"
    And the heartbeat active_tasks count should be 1

  # Why: Graceful shutdown during an active task — the agent must
