    When a "feasibility" command and an "explore" command arrive simultaneously
    Then both commands should be accepted
    And the heartbeat active_tasks should report 2
    And both should eventually produce ResultPayloads

  # Why: Topic resolution must use nats-core Topics.resolve(), not
