  @edge-case @regression
  Scenario: All NATS subjects are resolved via nats-core Topics
    When the Architect Agent resolves its NATS subjects
    Then the command subject should be resolved via Topics.Agents.COMMAND
    And the result subject should be resolved via Topics.Agents.RESULT
    And the heartbeat subject should be resolved via Topics.Fleet.HEARTBEAT
    And the registration subject should be Topics.Fleet.REGISTER
    And the deregistration subject should be Topics.Fleet.DEREGISTER
