  # ━━ GROUP E: Security, Concurrency & Integration ━━

  # Why: Path traversal in docs_path or codebase_path could allow
  # access to files outside the intended scope
  @edge-case @negative
  Scenario: Agent rejects command args containing path traversal
    Given the Architect Agent is registered with the fleet
    When a CommandPayload arrives with command "greenfield"
      | field          | value                |
      | args.docs_path | /../../../etc/passwd |
      | args.scope     | full                 |
    Then the command should be rejected before invoking the session handler
    And a ResultPayload should be published with success false
    And the result should indicate the path is invalid

  # Why: NATS auth is the fleet's perimeter — an unauthenticated client
