  @edge-case @negative
  Scenario: Unauthenticated client cannot send commands to the agent
    Given the NATS server requires authentication
    And a client connects without valid credentials
    When the client attempts to publish to "agents.command.architect-agent"
    Then the NATS server should reject the publish
    And the Architect Agent should not receive the message

  # Why: Two agents starting with the same agent_id is a misconfiguration —
