  @edge-case
  Scenario: Simultaneous registration with the same agent_id resolves cleanly
    Given two Architect Agent instances start simultaneously
    And both publish manifests with agent_id "architect-agent"
    When both registration messages are processed by the registry
    Then exactly one manifest entry for "architect-agent" should exist
    And the entry should reflect the most recently received manifest

  # Why: A command arriving after NATS connect but before the manifest is
