  @edge-case
  Scenario: Command arriving before manifest publication is rejected
    Given the Architect Agent has connected to NATS
    But the manifest has not yet been published
    When a CommandPayload arrives on "agents.command.architect-agent"
    Then the agent should reject the command with a "not ready" status
    And a ResultPayload should indicate the agent is still starting

  # Why: Forward-compatibility — a newer envelope version should not crash
