  @edge-case
  Scenario: Agent handles a MessageEnvelope with an unknown schema version
    Given the Architect Agent is registered with the fleet
    When a MessageEnvelope arrives with version "2.0"
    And the agent only understands version "1.0"
    Then the agent should log a version mismatch warning
